---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Base title='projects'>
  <div class='profile-card projects-card' data-label='PROJECTS'>
    I'll be adding my web projects here soon, In the meantime, you can check out
    my GitHub:
    <a href='https://github.com/ai77ee' target='_blank' rel='noopener'
      >github.com/ai77ee</a
    >
  </div>
  <div class='profile-card projects-card' data-label='SIDE PROJECTS'>
    At home I have a small home server working as media center.
    <ul>
      <li>
        It's running on an old laptop with a duo core AMD CPU and 8GB of RAM
        with Ubuntu Server and Docker.
      </li>
      <li>
        Some of the apps I'm running on it are: <a
          href='https://jellyfin.org/docs/general/installation/container'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener'>Jellyfin</a
        > for movies/shows and anime and <a
          href='https://www.navidrome.org/docs/installation/docker/'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener'>Navidrome</a
        > for music streaming.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div></Base
>
